//   Off      -> passes msg on untouched (no msg.phase_plus).
//   Monitor  -> adds msg.phase_plus with mode 'Monitor'. Strategies and the guard only ACT when
//               msg.phase_plus.mode === 'Enforce', so HBC behaves exactly as before.
//   Enforce  -> same plan, now used by Load distribution, Max power (Charge/Sell) and the Phase guard.
// On an error: warning + msg passed on without msg.phase_plus. Off / Monitor -> today's HBC; Enforce ->
// msg.phase_plus_failed makes Set Batteries apply the strict fail-safe rule (HBC+ 2026-11-15).
//
// msg.phase_plus = {
